      "normalized_sha256": "9f3646175b8c8b5cb64ba75a517ccb682e19312b8c145a72deccf1c5a90bad2a",
      "rationale": "This guarded base equation defines standaloneLastLetter on empty IntSeq values as false; it is part of the mathematical summary and does not replace program execution.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-9f3646175b8c8b5cb64ba75a517ccb682e19312b8c145a72deccf1c5a90bad2a",
      "start_line": 10,
      "text": "  rule standaloneLastLetter(IS:IntSeq) => false\n    requires isLen(IS) ==Int 0"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 15,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "4df32a98b335031084e1e2d44c77c3aee9afd5f217f99ad1251e817e7d17ce01",
      "rationale": "This guarded equation defines standaloneLastLetter for positive-length inputs whose final modeled character is nonalphabetic; it is a case of the result summary.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-4df32a98b335031084e1e2d44c77c3aee9afd5f217f99ad1251e817e7d17ce01",
      "start_line": 13,
      "text": "  rule standaloneLastLetter(IS:IntSeq) => false\n    requires isLen(IS) >Int 0\n      andBool notBool isAlphaC(intSeqAt(IS, isLen(IS) -Int 1))"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 19,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "4e7aa14452104b02dfb2ee9c7d2e2129c943e23411864d4a7c094fc06634aada",
      "rationale": "This guarded equation defines the one-character alphabetic case of standaloneLastLetter as true and is part of the summary's case split.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-4e7aa14452104b02dfb2ee9c7d2e2129c943e23411864d4a7c094fc06634aada",
      "start_line": 17,
      "text": "  rule standaloneLastLetter(IS:IntSeq) => true\n    requires isLen(IS) ==Int 1\n      andBool isAlphaC(intSeqAt(IS, 0))"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 24,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "cde37f71888ce75952bb23d314c3a846093f8ef594206ebe110b61ae7652000a",
      "rationale": "This guarded equation defines the longer alphabetic case by testing whether the penultimate code is literal space code 32; it completes the mathematical result summary.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-cde37f71888ce75952bb23d314c3a846093f8ef594206ebe110b61ae7652000a",
      "start_line": 21,
      "text": "  rule standaloneLastLetter(IS:IntSeq)\n    => intSeqAt(IS, isLen(IS) -Int 2) ==Int 32\n    requires isLen(IS) >Int 1\n      andBool isAlphaC(intSeqAt(IS, isLen(IS) -Int 1))"
    }
  ],
