      "rationale": "This simplification adds the mathematical constructor-disjointness fact that a nonempty iCons IntSeq is not .IntSeq. Stage 1 compiles the rule into VERIFICATION before every kprove command and contains no prior lemma-free proof of this exact statement, so it is trusted rather than proved.",
