      "normalized_sha256": "61ffc6cd69c6bad2d2ff37db34f5511581d591c5239127275c27ebf328e89030",
      "rationale": "This simplification adds the mathematical injectivity fact reducing equality of singleton iCons sequences to equality of their integer codes. Stage 1 compiles the rule into VERIFICATION before every kprove command and contains no prior lemma-free proof of this exact statement, so it is trusted rather than proved.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-61ffc6cd69c6bad2d2ff37db34f5511581d591c5239127275c27ebf328e89030",
      "start_line": 33,
      "text": "  rule iCons(C:Int, .IntSeq) ==K iCons(D:Int, .IntSeq)\n    => C ==Int D\n    [simplification]"
